        {(en ? rolloutEn : rollout).map((r, i) => (<li style={`--i:${i}`}><span class="n">{i + 1}</span><h3 class="h4">{r.t}</h3><p class="body">{r.d}</p></li>))}
      </ol>
      <div class="poc reveal">
        <div>
          <h3 class="h4">{en ? <>What we look at together in the initial consultation and the consulting/PoC</> : <>사전 컨설팅과 컨설팅/PoC에서 함께 보는 것</>}</h3>
          <div class="poc-groups">
            {(en ? pocGroupsEn : pocGroups).map((g) => (<div><p class="poc-k">{g.k}</p><ul>{g.items.map((c) => <li><Icon name="check" size={18} />{c}</li>)}</ul></div>))}
