  <CtaBand title={en ? "Trust Gateway\nStart with an initial consultation" : "Trust Gateway\n사전 컨설팅으로 먼저 시작하세요"} lead={en ? "Together we assess the security risks of how staff access work today, and discuss what to change first in light of published Zero Trust standards." : "지금 업무 접속의 보안 위험을 함께 진단하고, 공개된 제로트러스트 기준에 비춰 무엇부터 바꿀지 의논합니다."} />
</Base>

<style>
  /* attacks: each card gets a stamp when it comes into view */
  .atk { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .atk li { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 12px; align-content: start; padding: 24px 22px 26px; border-radius: var(--r-xl); background: #fff; }
  .a-try { display: grid; gap: 6px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.4; padding-right: 64px; }
  .a-def { display: grid; gap: 6px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); color: var(--ink-2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .a-k { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #b4443a; }
  .a-def .a-k { color: var(--blue); }
  .stamp { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 18px; padding: 4px 10px; border: 2px solid #c94a3a; border-radius: 8px; color: #c94a3a; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .04em; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  :global(.js) .atk li .stamp { opacity: 0; }
  :global(.js) .atk li.is-in .stamp { animation: stamp .45s var(--ease) calc(.5s + var(--i) * .15s) both; }
  @keyframes stamp { from { opacity: 0; transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1.8); } to { opacity: 1; transform: rotate(-8deg) scale(1); } }
  .rules { list-style: none; margin: 24px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .rules li { display: grid; gap: 4px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .rules b { font-size: 15px; }
  .rules p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); } /* a <p>, so each sentence starts on its own line (house style) */

  /* uses: tabs */
  .tabs { background: var(--paper-2); border-radius: var(--r-xl); padding: 12px; }
  .tablist { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; padding: 6px; background: #fff; border-radius: 999px; width: fit-content; max-width: 100%; margin: 0 auto 8px; }
  .tablist button { border: 0; background: transparent; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 999px; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .tablist button[aria-selected='true'] { background: var(--ink); color: #fff; }
  .tablist button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--orange); outline-offset: 2px; }
  .panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 36px clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px) 40px; align-items: start; }
  .panel[hidden] { display: none; }
  .pg { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--blue); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .panel .body { margin-top: 14px; }
  .panel ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .panel li { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: var(--r-md); background: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .panel li :global(svg) { flex: none; color: var(--blue); }

  .n { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 800; color: var(--blue); border: 2px solid var(--blue); }



  /* start: three steps on a line that fills in, then what the PoC/consulting shows */
  .roll { position: relative; list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
  /* the line runs centre to centre behind the circles (36px, so centred at 17px + 1px) and shows only between them */
  .roll::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 18px; right: calc((100% - 60px) / 4 - 18px); top: 17px; height: 2px; background: var(--line); }
  .roll::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 18px; right: calc((100% - 60px) / 4 - 18px); top: 17px; height: 2px; background: var(--orange); transform-origin: left; transform: scaleX(1); }
  :global(.js) .roll::after { transform: scaleX(0); transition: transform 1.6s var(--ease) .3s; }
  :global(.js) .roll.is-in::after { transform: scaleX(1); }
  .roll li { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 10px; align-content: start; }
  .roll .n { position: relative; z-index: 1; background: #fff; }
  .roll li:first-child .n { background: var(--orange); border-color: var(--orange); color: #1a1209; }
  .poc { margin-top: 40px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 24px; align-items: end; padding: 28px; border-radius: var(--r-xl); background: var(--orange-soft); }
  .poc-groups { margin-top: 16px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 20px 32px; }
  .poc-k { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--orange-ink); }
  .poc ul { list-style: none; margin: 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .poc li { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; font-weight: 600; }
  .poc li :global(svg) { flex: none; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--orange-ink); }

  /* questions */
  .faq { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
  .faq details { background: #fff; border-radius: var(--r-lg); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .faq summary { list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 22px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px; cursor: pointer; }
  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .faq summary :global(.faq-i) { flex: none; color: var(--ink-3); transition: rotate .25s var(--ease); }
  .faq details[open] summary :global(.faq-i) { rotate: 45deg; color: var(--blue); }
  .faq summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--orange); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: var(--r-lg); }
  .faq details .body { padding: 0 22px 22px; }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .atk, .rules { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .panel { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .atk, .rules { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .tablist { border-radius: var(--r-md); }
    .roll { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .roll::before, .roll::after { left: 17px; right: auto; top: 18px; bottom: 18px; width: 2px; height: auto; }
    .roll::after { transform-origin: top; }
    :global(.js) .roll::after { transform: scaleY(0); }
    :global(.js) .roll.is-in::after { transform: scaleY(1); }
    .roll li { padding-left: 56px; }
    .roll .n { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; }
    .poc { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; }
    .poc-groups { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .head-center .lead br { display: none; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.js) .atk li .stamp { opacity: 1; animation: none; }
    :global(.js) .roll::after { transform: none; transition: none; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const tabs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('#uses [role="tab"]'));
  const select = (tab: HTMLButtonElement) => {
    for (const t of tabs) {
      const on = t === tab;
      t.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(on));
      t.tabIndex = on ? 0 : -1;
      const p = document.getElementById(t.getAttribute('aria-controls')!);
      if (p) p.hidden = !on;
    }
  };
  tabs.forEach((t, i) => {
    t.addEventListener('click', () => select(t));
    t.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      const d = e.key === 'ArrowRight' ? 1 : e.key === 'ArrowLeft' ? -1 : 0;
      if (!d) return;
      const next = tabs[(i + d + tabs.length) % tabs.length];
      select(next); next.focus();
    });
  });
</script>
